(The ledger's control-flow leaves, batch A - docs/ledger/control-flow.md
 rows FLW-05, FLW-07, FLW-21, FLW-28, FLW-41.

 Each leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted
 source printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox itself - the
 same reason 300_gen_buffers_a does it this way: these leaves exist to
 emit assertions, and an assertion whose rendered text drifts is an
 assertion nobody is reading. All five leaves are TOP-LEVEL ONLY (see
 each one's own comment in src/gen_flow.vox), so every call here passes
 indent "" and nested false - the only position they are ever actually
 drawn in.

 FLW-07 is called at two seeds specifically because its whole claim is
 that BOTH branches are reachable and each is asserted correctly - one
 seed alone would only show one side. The counters are reset before
 every call so the golden's names stay small and stable across
 unrelated test edits; the LAST block below deliberately does not reset
 between two calls, to prove two draws of the same leaf in one program
 never collide on a name.)

Print "--- FLW-05: comma-separated actions in the Otherwise arm ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
Set gen_flow_branches to 0.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf if comma actions otherwise' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FLW-07: Otherwise on its own line after the period, THEN arm wins ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
Set gen_flow_chains to 0.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf if otherwise across newline' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FLW-07 again, a seed where the OTHERWISE arm wins instead ---".
'rng seed' of 4.
Set gen_flow_chains to 0.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf if otherwise across newline' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FLW-21: the list form of For each over an empty list ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
Set gen_lists to 0.
Set gen_flow_empties to 0.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf empty list loop' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FLW-28: a Repeat nested in a For each, closed by stacked periods ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
Set gen_flow_stacks to 0.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf stacked periods' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FLW-41: terminate, lower case ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf terminate' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FLW-41 again, upper case ---".
'rng seed' of 8.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf terminate' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- two FLW-05 draws in one program never collide on a name ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
Set gen_flow_branches to 0.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf if comma actions otherwise' of "" and false.
'gen leaf if comma actions otherwise' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.
